        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance and examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Looks well and alert, with anxious affect; no obvious pallor or diaphoresis. Cardiovascular examination: heart sounds dual, no murmur or oedema. Respiratory examination clear bilaterally. Abdomen soft and non-tender, no masses and no hepatosplenomegaly felt. Hands, knees and ankles without synovitis, warmth, effusion or tenderness to palpation; full range of motion and normal gait. Neurological examination grossly non-focal."
      }
    },
